B.Y4=new A.UR("SOUTH AFRICA'S LEADING AUCTION COMPANY","WHERE BUYERS AND SELLERS MEET ","OPPORTUNITY","",B.RM,"VIEW AUCTION CALENDAR","SEE OUR STATS","VISIT OUR BRANCHES","NEXT AUCTION","MORE SOON",B.QM,"ON THE BLOCK","BY THE NUMBERS","A HISTORY BUILT ON THE HAMMER","SEE ALL STATISTICS \u2192",B.SY,"AUCTIONS IN","Livestock, stud, game, property, online and clearance.","COUNTRYWIDE, EVERY WEEK","AUCTIONS","UPCOMING AUCTIONS","RECENT RESULTS","AUCTION TYPE","ALL","VIEW CATALOGUE \u2192","ADD TO CALENDAR","lots on offer","No upcoming auctions of this type in the next fortnight. Try another type, or view the full calendar.","The auctions could not be loaded right now. Please try again shortly.","Recent results","Auction results, with the total sales, the top price and the clearance rate of each sale, are coming soon. The auction statistics page already shows the market figures.","90 YEARS IN THE RING","YOUR STOCK. YOUR LAND. ","THE BEST BID.","TERMS AVAILABLE.","Approved buyers can buy on terms. Ask your nearest branch.","For 90 years, when South African farmers have brought their animals to market, Vleissentraal has been standing at the rail beside them. Our name grew up with livestock marketing in this country, sale by sale and handshake by handshake, and we are still right there in the thick of organised agriculture.","Our job comes down to one thing: getting you the very best value for your livestock, game and property. We negotiate terms that are fair to the seller and the buyer alike, and our technology keeps every sale quick, accurate and transparent, from the first lot to the final hammer.","We hold around 1 700 auctions a year, so there is very little we haven't seen. Our independent auctioneers and marketers know the market inside out and read supply and demand on the day, so the price you get is the best the market can give.","BUYING OR SELLING, HERE IS WHAT YOU CAN COUNT ON:",B.SN,"READY TO RAISE YOUR HAND?","Register once, then bid on site or online at auctions across the country.","REGISTER TO BID","GET THE WEEKLY AUCTION E-MAIL","you@farm.co.za","SUBSCRIBE","South Africa's leading auction company. Livestock, game, properties and moveable assets, countrywide.","AUCTIONS","SERVICES","COMPANY","Auction calendar","Recent results","iCal feed",B.Tc,"Branches","Statistics","Contact us","\xa9 2026 VLEISSENTRAAL. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.")
